@startuml supported-launch-paths
title Supported Local Launch Paths
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

' Source evidence baseline: commit 1f801dbb82bdda30478e3354e685e3153b179a0c.
' Source: campusclaw.sh, detect_jdk21 and main launch flow.
' Source: install.sh, detect_jdk21 and add_to_path.
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/cron/SystemSchedulerInstaller.java, install and detectLauncherScript.
' Observed behavior: the baseline also contains Batch, PowerShell, Maven CMD, and Task Scheduler launch paths.
' Target design: maintain only macOS and Linux local launch and scheduler paths.
' Review correction baseline: d7c218478faf3577044352b2720f5e8d35a2d745.
' Review finding: the generated global wrapper duplicated launch logic without the OS guard.
' Target correction: the generated wrapper delegates to campusclaw.sh and shares its OS guard.
' Build exception: mvnw may retain best-effort Cygwin and MinGW build compatibility.
' Product constraint: Windows local launch is outside the supported platform contract.

actor "macOS user" as MacUser
actor "Linux user" as LinuxUser
component "install.sh" as Installer
component "campusclaw.sh" as Launcher
component "Maven Wrapper\nmvnw" as Maven
component "CampusClaw JAR" as Jar
component "SystemSchedulerInstaller" as Scheduler
component "launchd" as Launchd
component "crontab" as Crontab

MacUser --> Installer : install command
LinuxUser --> Installer : install command
Installer --> Launcher : create wrapper
MacUser --> Launcher : launch CLI
LinuxUser --> Launcher : launch CLI
Launcher --> Maven : build when needed
Launcher --> Jar : java -jar ... cli
Scheduler --> Launchd : macOS cron tick
Scheduler --> Crontab : Linux cron tick
Launchd --> Launcher : --cron-tick
Crontab --> Launcher : --cron-tick

note bottom of Scheduler
Other operating systems are rejected.
No fallback scheduler is selected.
end note
@enduml
